<mi>p</mi><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></msubsup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\ell_p^{\\min}, \\ell_p^{\\max}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2136em;vertical-align:-0.3831em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">ℓ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8305em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3831em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">ℓ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6644em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3831em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是该部位的可接受余量（例如胸围余量 0~6cm 为合身，负值即过紧）。注意这是逐部位的<strong>合取</strong>：只要一个部位严重不合，整体就不合身——臀围合适但腰围过紧的裤子依然不能穿。这解释了为什么单一「推荐尺码」常常不够，需要按部位呈现。</p>\n<p>现实的困难在于右侧：绝大多数商品没有 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>g</mi><mo>⃗</mo></mover><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\vec{g}_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9084em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.714em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.2077em;\"><span class=\"overlay\" style=\"height:0.714em;width:0.471em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.471em\" height=\"0.714em\" style=\"width:0.471em\" viewBox=\"0 0 471 714\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin\"><path d=\"M377 20c0-5.333 1.833-10 5.5-14S391 0 397 0c4.667 0 8.667 1.667 12 5\n3.333 2.667 6.667 9 10 19 6.667 24.667 20.333 43.667 41 57 7.333 4.667 11\n10.667 11 18 0 6-1 10-3 12s-6.667 5-14 9c-28.667 14.667-53.667 35.667-75 63\n-1.333 1.333-3.167 3.5-5.5 6.5s-4 4.833-5 5.5c-1 .667-2.5 1.333-4.5 2s-4.333 1\n-7 1c-4.667 0-9.167-1.833-13.5-5.5S337 184 337 178c0-12.667 15.667-32.333 47-59\nH213l-171-1c-8.667-6-13-12.333-13-19 0-4.667 4.333-11.333 13-20h359\nc-16-25.333-24-45-24-59z\"/></svg></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，只有尺码标签。所以合身推荐的工程路径分两步——先把标签变成版型画像，再做匹配。</p>\n<h2 id=\"从退货数据反推版型偏移\">从退货数据反推版型偏移</h2><p>服饰平台有一个别的品类羡慕的数据资产：<strong>退货原因结构化后，可以直接反推出每个商品、每个品牌的版型偏差</strong>。这是解决 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>g</mi><mo>⃗</mo></mover><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\vec{g}_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9084em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.714em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.2077em;\"><span class=\"overlay\" style=\"height:0.714em;width:0.471em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.471em\" height=\"0.714em\" style=\"width:0.471em\" viewBox=\"0 0 471 714\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin\"><path d=\"M377 20c0-5.333 1.833-10 5.5-14S391 0 397 0c4.667 0 8.667 1.667 12 5\n3.333 2.667 6.667 9 10 19 6.667 24.667 20.333 43.667 41 57 7.333 4.667 11\n10.667 11 18 0 6-1 10-3 12s-6.667 5-14 9c-28.667 14.667-53.667 35.667-75 63\n-1.333 1.333-3.167 3.5-5.5 6.5s-4 4.833-5 5.5c-1 .667-2.5 1.333-4.5 2s-4.333 1\n-7 1c-4.667 0-9.167-1.833-13.5-5.5S337 184 337 178c0-12.667 15.667-32.333 47-59\nH213l-171-1c-8.667-6-13-12.333-13-19 0-4.667 4.333-11.333 13-20h359\nc-16-25.333-24-45-24-59z\"/></svg></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 缺失最经济的手段。</p>\n<p>设品牌 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">b</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span></span></span></span></span> 在尺码 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span></span></span></span></span> 上的退货率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>R</mi><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>s</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R_{b,s}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">b</span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，如果某品牌 L 码的退货率显著高于同类目均值，且退货原因集中在「偏小」，则说明该品牌标 L 但实际偏小。量化为版型偏移量：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>δ</mi><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>s</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mfrac><msubsup><mi>R</mi><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>s</mi></mrow><mtext>偏小</mtext></msubsup><msubsup><mi>R</mi><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>s</mi></mrow><mtext>偏大</mtext></msubsup></mfrac><mo>⋅</mo><mi>κ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\delta_{b,s} = \\log\\frac{R_{b,s}^{\\text{偏小}}}{R_{b,s}^{\\text{偏大}}} \\cdot \\kappa</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9805em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0379em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">b</span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.8011em;vertical-align:-1.1505em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.6505em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.2869em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8231em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.3987em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">b</span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.0448em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">偏大</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4374em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.8092em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8413em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4169em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">b</span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">偏小</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4192em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1505em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">κ</span></span></span></span></span></div><p><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>δ</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\delta &gt; 0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7335em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span> 表示偏小（用户觉得紧，需要买大），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>δ</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\delta &lt; 0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7335em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span> 表示偏大。<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>κ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\kappa</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">κ</span></span></span></span></span> 是缩放系数，通过对有完整尺码表的商品做回归标定——那些商品我们知道真实成衣尺寸与用户身体数据的差值，可以反过来确定「退货率比值 → 厘米偏移」的换算。这需要用「同一品牌、有尺码表」的商品作为训练集，把偏移量映射到厘米。</p>\n<p>有了 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>δ</mi><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>s</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\delta_{b,s}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9805em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0379em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">b</span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，即使没有完整尺码表，也能给用户一个校正建议：品牌标注「L」+ 偏移 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>δ</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>+</mo><mn>0.4</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\delta = +0.4</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">+</span><span class=\"mord\">0.4</span></span></span></span></span> → 建议该品牌买 XL。</p>\n<p><strong>这套方法的三个前提</strong>，缺一不可：退货原因必须结构化（自由文本无法统计）、退货比例要按「尺码 × 品牌 × 类目」分层（混在一起算会被产品结构变化污染）、需要足够样本量（单品牌单尺码月退货量低于阈值时不输出建议，宁可不说也不要给错建议）。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>数据源</th>\n<th>可得性</th>\n<th>精度</th>\n<th>覆盖</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>详情页尺码表</td>\n<td>中（约 40%~70% 服饰商品）</td>\n<td>高（商家实测）</td>\n<td>有限</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>退货原因 + 退货率</td>\n<td>高（平台自有）</td>\n<td>中（需校准）</td>\n<td>全量</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>用户身体画像（主动填）</td>\n<td>低（主动填写率低）</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>有限</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>历史购买尺码 + 是否退货</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>复购用户</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>试穿/上身图（UGC）</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>长尾</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>实践中把这几路证据融合成一个版型画像，降级顺序是：有尺码表用尺码表，无尺码表用退货反推，两者都无则只用品牌级偏移（粒度更粗但仍有价值）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"用户侧画像的冷启动\">用户侧画像的冷启动</h2><p>用户侧同样难：主动填写身高体重的用户比例很低。三条渐进路径：</p>\n<p><strong>路径一：从历史订单反推。</strong> 用户买过且未退货的商品，其尺码标签与品牌偏移共同给出一个身体尺寸的估计区间。多次未退货购买可以收窄区间。这是主要信号源，但只对复购用户有效。</p>\n<p><strong>路径二：从浏览与筛选行为推断。</strong> 用户如果持续只点击某尺码、或持续使用「加长款」「大码」筛选，这是粗粒度的体型信号。可用来做初始区间的粗定位，精度有限。</p>\n<p><strong>路径三：一次轻交互替代大量推断。</strong> 在结果页给一个极简的输入（身高 + 体重两栏，或体型图选择），用一次交互换到高精度画像，并承诺只用于尺码推荐。<strong>这个交互的位置很关键</strong>——放在用户已经表达购买意图之后（点进商品或使用尺码筛选时）转化率远高于首次搜索时弹出。这属于 <a href=\"../beauty-fresh-other/vertical-result-ui\">各品类结果页展示差异</a> 的交互设计范围。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    U[用户] --&gt;|历史订单| P1[身体画像估计]&#10;    U --&gt;|筛选/浏览| P2[体型粗定位]&#10;    U --&gt;|轻交互| P3[高精度画像]&#10;    P1 --&gt; F[融合画像]&#10;    P2 --&gt; F&#10;    P3 --&gt; F&#10;    I[商品] --&gt;|尺码表| G1[版型画像]&#10;    I --&gt;|退货反推| G2[版型偏移]&#10;    I --&gt;|品牌级偏移| G3[品牌画像]&#10;    G1 --&gt; G[融合版型]&#10;    G2 --&gt; G&#10;    G3 --&gt; G&#10;    F --&gt; M[逐部位余量匹配]&#10;    G --&gt; M&#10;    M --&gt; R[尺码建议 + 部位提示]\">graph TD\n    U[用户] --&gt;|历史订单| P1[身体画像估计]\n    U --&gt;|筛选/浏览| P2[体型粗定位]\n    U --&gt;|轻交互| P3[高精度画像]\n    P1 --&gt; F[融合画像]\n    P2 --&gt; F\n    P3 --&gt; F\n    I[商品] --&gt;|尺码表| G1[版型画像]\n    I --&gt;|退货反推| G2[版型偏移]\n    I --&gt;|品牌级偏移| G3[品牌画像]\n    G1 --&gt; G[融合版型]\n    G2 --&gt; G\n    G3 --&gt; G\n    F --&gt; M[逐部位余量匹配]\n    G --&gt; M\n    M --&gt; R[尺码建议 + 部位提示]</pre><h2 id=\"合身信号如何进入排序\">合身信号如何进入排序</h2><p>尺码推荐是显式能力，但更隐性的价值在于<strong>合身信号进入排序</strong>。两件相似的连衣裙，一件对当前用户有明确合身建议、另一件尺码数据缺失，前者应该排前面——因为它降低了用户的决策成本与退货风险。</p>\n<p>排序中的合身特征设计：</p>\n<p><strong>尺码匹配度（匹配信号）。</strong> 用户画像与商品版型画像的匹配程度，映射到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">[0,1]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span>。有高置信度画像时权重高，画像缺失时该项置为中性值（不要置 0，那会系统性打压）。</p>\n<p><strong>尺码数据完整度（属性信号）。</strong> 商品是否提供尺码表、尺码属性的置信度。这是一个弱但稳定的正信号，也与平台的长期目标一致——它鼓励商家补全数据。</p>\n<p><strong>预期退货风险（行为信号，负向）。</strong> 该品牌该尺码的历史退货率，经过 <a href=\"../category-search-diff/category-specific-ranking\">品类化排序信号</a> 中的贝叶斯平滑与品类内归一化后作为负向特征。注意它必须与「尺码匹配度」交互——当用户画像明确且匹配度高时，品牌级的退货风险应被削弱，因为个体匹配比群体统计更可信。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>S</mi><mtext>fit</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>α</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mtext>match</mtext><mo>+</mo><mi>β</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mtext>completeness</mtext><mo>−</mo><mi>γ</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mtext>returnrisk</mtext><mo>⋅</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mtext>match</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S_{\\text{fit}} = \\alpha \\cdot \\text{match} + \\beta \\cdot \\text{completeness} - \\gamma \\cdot \\text{returnrisk} \\cdot (1 - \\text{match})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">fit</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4445em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">match</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">completeness</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">γ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">returnrisk</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">match</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>乘积项 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mtext>match</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(1 - \\text{match})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">match</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 表达的正是上述交互：匹配越确定，退货风险的惩罚越小。</p>\n<h2 id=\"边界与失效场景\">边界与失效场景</h2><p>合身推荐有几类必须明确承认的失效情形，正确做法是<strong>在这些情形下不给出建议</strong>，而不是给出一个勉强的建议——错误的尺码建议比没有建议造成的伤害更大。</p>\n<p><strong>版型不可预测的设计款。</strong> 廓形夸张、oversize 设计、非常规剪裁的商品，尺码标签与身体尺寸的解耦程度很高，历史数据也少。这类商品应只展示商家尺码表，不做算法推荐。</p>\n<p><strong>尺码表与实物不符。</strong> 商家虚标（把 L 标成 M 卖）会在数据上表现为该商品退货率异常但方向不一致。检测手段是看退货原因是否分散在「偏大」「偏小」两侧——两侧都高说明尺码表本身不可信，应把该商品从版型画像训练集中剔除并触发商家数据质量告警。</p>\n<p><strong>跨性别与儿童品类。</strong> 童装的「合身」维度是身高增长速率与预留余量，逻辑与成人不同（家长往往主动买大一码）；内衣与泳装的合身涉及隐私与特殊尺码体系。这些品类应使用独立规则，不要套用成人服装模型。</p>\n<p><strong>退货率的地板效应。</strong> 某些品类（如配饰）本身退货率极低，退货数据无区分度。此时版型偏移反推不成立，应回退到只用尺码表数据。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>失效场景</th>\n<th>检测方式</th>\n<th>应对</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>设计款版型不可预测</td>\n<td>款式标签含 oversize/廓形 + 样本量低</td>\n<td>只展示商家尺码表</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>尺码表虚标</td>\n<td>退货原因双侧分散</td>\n<td>剔除训练集 + 商家告警</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>童装/内衣品类</td>\n<td>品类树判断</td>\n<td>用独立规则</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>退货率无区分度</td>\n<td>品类基线下限检查</td>\n<td>只用尺码表</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>合身是逐部位余量的合取问题，任一部位严重不合即整体不合，因此按部位呈现比单一推荐码更有用。</li>\n<li>商品侧版型画像靠三路证据融合：详情页尺码表（高精度低覆盖）、退货原因反推的品牌偏移（低精度全覆盖）、品牌级画像（最粗）。</li>\n<li>用户侧画像靠历史订单反推为主，筛选行为粗定位为辅，一次轻交互换取高精度，交互时机应放在购买意图明确之后。</li>\n<li>合身信号进入排序用「匹配度 + 数据完整度 − 退货风险 × (1 − 匹配度)」，其中交互项确保个体匹配能覆盖群体统计。</li>\n<li>四类失效场景（设计款、尺码虚标、童装内衣、退货地板效应）应明确不给建议或走独立规则，错误建议的伤害大于无建议。</li>\n<li>属性抽取是本篇的前提，见 <a href=\"size-color-style-attr\">尺码/颜色/款式/材质结构化</a>；视觉侧的相似款匹配能补足尺码数据缺失的缺口，见 <a href=\"visual-fashion-search\">以图搜款与相似款</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"尺码兼容与合身推荐","id":"尺码兼容与合身推荐"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：合身问题的形式化","id":"核心概念-合身问题的形式化"},{"level":2,"text":"从退货数据反推版型偏移","id":"从退货数据反推版型偏移"},{"level":2,"text":"用户侧画像的冷启动","id":"用户侧画像的冷启动"},{"level":2,"text":"合身信号如何进入排序","id":"合身信号如何进入排序"},{"level":2,"text":"边界与失效场景","id":"边界与失效场景"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"尺码/颜色/款式/材质结构化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/vertical-category-search/fashion-apparel-search/size-color-style-attr"},"next":{"title":"以图搜款与相似款","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/vertical-category-search/fashion-apparel-search/visual-fashion-search"}}